(text "OUT0 strobe f_s      OUT1 ADC clock f_s (delayed)\nOUT2 calibrator / TDR step f_sig      OUT3 f_sig to MCU (time zero)\n~{OE} low = outputs on; I2C_SEL low = SPI" (at 233.68 276.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid e9a2351f-1909-5822-8ff0-f89eb472d525))
(text "TRIGGER INPUT  -  ADCMP572 squares the trigger signal; its output is PLL reference IN1 (periodic signals only).\nVCCI = 5 V gives an input range of -0.2 ... +3.1 V.  R53 (hysteresis) per datasheet figure 7." (at 591.82 27.94 0) (effects (font (size 2.2 2.2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 06ecb1f3-9647-5258-a7c0-61bb3f0fe9ec))
